# TheKnockoutAcademy V2 — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for development. Set values in Vercel project env for production.
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ to the client bundle.

# ─── Tracking ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Tag Manager container ID. Get the real ID from tagmanager.google.com.
# GTM-XXXXXXX is a placeholder marker — leave as-is until the real container
# exists, then swap in .env.local (dev) or Vercel env (prod). The gtm.js fetch
# 404s with the placeholder, but window.dataLayer is still created so buffered
# tracking events flush correctly once a real container is configured.
VITE_GTM_CONTAINER_ID=GTM-XXXXXXX

# Microsoft Clarity project ID. Get it from clarity.microsoft.com after creating
# a project. Empty value disables Clarity (the script 404s harmlessly).
VITE_CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=

# First-party tracking subdomain proxied via the Cloudflare Worker in
# infra/cloudflare-worker.js. Used by client-side tracking to route GA4 hits
# through a first-party origin (bypasses ad blockers + iOS ATT). Leave empty
# until the worker is deployed.
VITE_TRACK_DOMAIN=track.theknockoutacademy.com

# ─── Shopify Storefront API ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Currently hardcoded in src/lib/shopify.ts; these are future-migration vars.
# Don't change shopify.ts in Session 2 — that integration works.
VITE_SHOPIFY_DOMAIN=lovable-project-0ijbf.myshopify.com
VITE_SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_TOKEN=

# ─── Klaviyo ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Currently hardcoded in src/lib/klaviyo.ts; future-migration vars.
# The public site/company ID (TZVW2b) is safe in the client bundle — Klaviyo's
# public key only permits subscribe/track operations, not data reads.
VITE_KLAVIYO_PUBLIC_KEY=TZVW2b
VITE_KLAVIYO_LIST_ID=Tr4Qa6
